{
  "duration": 68.139,
  "phrases": [
    {
      "start": 0.14,
      "end": 0.28,
      "text": "So"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.859,
      "end": 1.879,
      "text": "welcome back again."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.539,
      "end": 3.899,
      "text": "Time for one more problem."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.5,
      "end": 5.279,
      "text": "Now in this problem,"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.699,
      "end": 7.779,
      "text": "the speed of a truck without stoppages"
    },
    {
      "start": 8.3,
      "end": 10.019,
      "text": "is sixty kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.599,
      "end": 12.059,
      "text": "But when we include the stoppages,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.579,
      "end": 15.279,
      "text": "its average speed becomes fifty kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.839,
      "end": 20.059,
      "text": "The question is asking us to find how many minutes the truck stops in one hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.559,
      "end": 22.459,
      "text": "Now let us take a total time of one hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 27.479,
      "text": "Without any stoppage, the truck can cover sixty kilometer in one hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.939,
      "end": 31.719,
      "text": "But including the stoppages, it covers only fifty kilometers in the same one hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.2,
      "end": 33.319,
      "text": "So because of the stoppages,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.759,
      "end": 36.879,
      "text": "the truck covers ten kilometers less."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.34,
      "end": 37.759,
      "text": "Correct?"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.18,
      "end": 44.059,
      "text": "Now we need to find how much time the truck takes to cover this ten kilometers at its running speed of sixty kilometers per hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.539,
      "end": 48.179,
      "text": "We know that time is equal to distance divided by speed."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.619,
      "end": 51.939,
      "text": "So the stoppage time is equal to ten divided by sixty hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.479,
      "end": 54.619,
      "text": "This is equal to one by six hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.099,
      "end": 56.619,
      "text": "Now we convert this into minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.099,
      "end": 61.039,
      "text": "One by six multiplied by sixty gives us ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.479,
      "end": 61.879,
      "text": "Hence,"
    },
    {
      "start": 62.34,
      "end": 64.759,
      "text": "the truck stops for ten minutes in one hour."
    },
    {
      "start": 65.26,
      "end": 68.139,
      "text": "So the final answer will be option C, ten minutes."
    }
  ],
